OL,3,ASemi-pro football club 'in shock' after
OL,4,Ashirt worn by Reading Festival
OL,5,Aheadliners
OL,6,
OL,7,FA semi-professional Welsh football club
OL,8,Fsay they were "in shock" after
OL,9,FFontaines D.C. singer wore their shirt
OL,10,Fduring the band's Reading Festival
OL,11,Fheadline set.
OL,13,FLead vocalist Grian Chatten was seen
OL,14,Fsporting a green and white-striped
OL,15,FCwmbran away shirt during the
OL,16,Fperformance on Friday, leading to
OL,17,Fpre-sales of the shirt to "almost
OL,18,Fdouble".
