OL,3,ASemi-pro football club 'in shock' after
OL,4,Ashirt worn by Reading Festival
OL,5,Aheadliners
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn a post shared on social media, the
OL,8,Fclub said "we're still in shock and
OL,9,Fcan't thank Grian enough for the
OL,10,Fsupport".
OL,12,FSales of the shirt go both towards
OL,13,Fsupporting the club as well as to
OL,14,Fgrassroots music venues, with the club
OL,15,Fhaving partnered with four famous bands
OL,16,Ffor their 2026/27 season team kits.
